WEBVTT

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:06.810
Suzumegahara Municipal Junior High

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.740
<b>Kamiya Agari</b>

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.740
<b>Tenka Hanabi</b>

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.740
<b>Itsumo Hokuto</b>

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.740
<b>Tsumujikaze Koyori</b>

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:15.540
<b></b>

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.250
<i>Prefectural semifinalist...</i>

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.120
G-Good morning!

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.320
K-Kamiya-san! Morning!

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.030
M-Morning.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.630
You're here early again.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.140
I'm always first in.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.060
The earlier I come, the more I can practice.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.950
I had the same idea and woke up early,

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:38.440
but I got lost for 30 minutes on the way.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.830
30 minutes?

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.600
Oh, but it was an hour yesterday.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.010
I'll be fine tomorrow...

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:46.690
Right?

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.560
Uh, don't ask me.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.420
Morning. You two are here early.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:52.530
Good morning.

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:55.730
Good morning!

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.770
Go ahead and warm up first.

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:00.050
Once everyone's here, we'll go running.

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:00.690
Got it.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.720
Let's go get changed, Koyori-chan.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:06.890
Y-Yeah.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.380
30 minutes?

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:16.880
<b>Tsumujikaze Koyori</b>

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.100
Did she really make the semis?

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:45.160
<b>Scorching</b>

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:45.160
<b>Ping Pong Girls</b>

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:51.810
<b>Second Serve</b>

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:51.810
<b>Unrelinquishable Spot</b>

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:56.450
Suzumegahara!

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:58.350
Fight! Fight!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:00.700
Fight! Fight!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.790
Suzumegahara!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.960
Will Koyori-senpai play matches again today?

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.960
Fight! Fight!

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.630
Fight! Fight!

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:07.080
Probably. There are only 
three people above her now.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:11.580
Then, she'll have to face Hokuto-senpai 
first, and then Hanabi-senpai.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.410
I wonder just how good Koyori-senpai is.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:20.660
No idle chatter while running.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:22.090
We're sorry!

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:27.540
Are you okay, Koyori-chan?

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.310
Yeah!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.900
I-I'm sorry...

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:33.650
Just run at your own pace, okay?

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:39.090
What's wrong, Taily? Already beat?

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:41.660
Can't she handle running?

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:46.780
That side of her is totally different 
than when she's playing table tennis.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.570
What an amusing gal.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.760
I think you're probably better, Hokuto!

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.250
Don't squeeze.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:59.460
Thanks, though.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:05.140
<b>Class 2-3</b>

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:08.390
It's lunch break! Time to eat!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.690
Hang on. I'll go get Hokuto.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:18.570
S-Sorry!

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.950
Once I realized it was finally 
lunch, I couldn't stop it.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:23.990
Don't worry about it.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:25.990
I mean, it's been growling all morning.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:26.990
You heard that?

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.700
It was so loud, I'd be deaf
if I <i>couldn't</i> hear it.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:32.750
Don't let it bother you!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.420
It just shows how hard you 
practiced this morning!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.130
You could even hear it all 
the way over in my class.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:39.870
Itsumo-san?

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:42.830
Sensei and my classmates all 
thought it was thunder at first

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.230
and looked out at the sky.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.140
You're kidding, right?

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.140
I am.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:51.600
You're such a prankster, Hokuto!

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:58.420
I won't go down as easily as Thong-senpai.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.400
Huh?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.580
Must be talking about the ranking match.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.490
You're gonna play Hokuto today, right?

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.230
Y-Yeah.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:06.950
Thong?

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.910
She means Munemune-senpai.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:14.460
Hokuto can read people by looking 
at their racket rubbers.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.360
Like, their personalities 
and their best moves.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.130
I can tell what kind of 
panties they wear, too.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.590
R-Really?

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.050
Really.

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:25.510
Really.

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:31.090
I got a good look at your play style 
during your match with Thong-senpai.

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:34.980
I'll have you know I'm not like her.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.130
Thong?

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:39.010
Thong?

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.210
Thong?!

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.820
Thong this, thong that! Enough already!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.650
Let's just hurry up and eat.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.360
Let's eat!

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:52.660
Give me that.

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:54.530
S-Sorry.

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:56.060
Jeez, it's fine.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:06.250
Koyori-senpai's facing third-ranker 
Hokuto-senpai today.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:09.010
Who's going to win?
Will the rankings change again?

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.510
Don't lose, Hokuto!

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:14.100
<i>In this school, Hokuto's skills are top-class.</i>

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.310
<i>If we're talking technique alone, 
she's far better than Munemune-senpai.</i>

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.890
<i>You need more than luck to beat her.</i>

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.030
Can I serve first?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:25.780
Sure.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:28.660
Pink...

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.260
Peach panties, huh?

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.120
Love-all.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:43.040
Koyori-senpai returned it.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.340
But it got sent back!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:49.660
Taily didn't return that.
She was <i>made</i> to return it.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.590
Huh?

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:54.530
By adjusting the location of her serve 
and the amount of spin on the ball,

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:57.790
Hokuto can make her opponents 
hit the ball where she wants.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:00.850
Only to a certain extent, though.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.290
It's still amazing!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:09.460
From there, she further 
whittles down her options

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:11.780
to pick the shot that's most likely 
to make her opponent mess up.

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:18.730
Before you know it,

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:22.170
Hokuto's already got all the momentum.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.500
Nice, Hokuto! That's the way!

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.090
<b>Tenka Hanabi

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.800
<i>I won't let you force your way in there.</i>

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:44.610
This is so one-sided.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.590
Hokuto-senpai's too good!

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:47.960
Right?

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:53.890
<i>Hokuto's tactics wear her out, too.</i>

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:55.490
<i>But...</i>

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:02.130
<i>Tsumujikaze-san will be the 
first to run out of energy.</i>

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:04.670
<i>Her play style takes even that into account.</i>

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:06.620
Suzume!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:07.090
Fight!

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:07.630
Yeah!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.110
Fight!

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:08.610
Yeah!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:09.030
Fight!

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:09.580
Yeah!

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:10.510
Suzume!

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:11.110
Fight!

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:11.580
Yeah!

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:12.030
Fight!

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:12.570
Yeah!

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:12.980
Fight!

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:13.610
Yeah!

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:14.660
Suzume!

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.460
<i>Running is hard,</i>

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:20.880
<i>waking up early is a pain,</i>

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:22.810
<i>and practice is exhausting.</i>

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.270
Serve.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:27.780
<i>But, yeah, table tennis really is fun.</i>

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:33.830
<i>Why is she smiling?</i>

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.330
<i>Crap. That's not good enough.</i>

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:47.960
Huh?

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.920
<i>How about this, then?</i>

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.310
<i>Why are you smiling?</i>

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.360
It's a rally.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.400
A fierce one, at that.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:14.220
What's wrong?

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:17.480
Hokuto's acting kinda different.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:20.230
<i>True.</i>

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:23.540
<i>I'm pretty sure she doesn't 
like long rallies.</i>

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.490
Her play is rougher than usual.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.430
But, hang in there, Hokuto!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.850
<i>What are you finding so fun?</i>

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.060
<i>Hokuto's starting to hit more smashes.</i>

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:52.530
<i>But her usual style eschews power to 
force errors through precise placement.</i>

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.420
How long is this rally going to last?

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:00.700
They're both amazing.

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:03.830
<i>Crap!</i>

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.030
It looped up?

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.810
Here's your chance, Hokuto-senpai!

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:26.060
Hokuto!

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:36.580
Koyori-senpai won the rally!

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:52.020
Don't worry, Hokuto.
You've still got a big lead.

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:54.920
You're right, Hanabi.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.080
Serve.

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.130
Thanks for a great game.

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.650
Too bad, Hokuto.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:13.980
But you put up an awesome fight!

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.210
I made a lot of errors in the latter half.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.950
I've got to practice much more.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.340
Yeah! Let's do our best together!

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.260
Get off me. I'm sweaty enough already.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:26.330
Aw, you're so cold!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.040
Itsumo-san.

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:32.460
Th-That was so fun.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:33.750
Thank you for playing me!

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:35.750
Thank you so much!

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.420
You're welcome, Peach Panties-san.

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:42.270
Peach? Peach panties?

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:44.460
Koyori-senpai's wearing peach panties?

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:50.350
<b>Tsumujikaze Koyori</b>

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:47.860
Peach!

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:48.970
That's so cute!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.350
Peach panties!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.280
<i>Tsumujikaze Koyori...</i>

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.230
<i>What a mysterious girl.</i>

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:01.170
Your play style was different than usual.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.280
What happened?

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:07.510
I think you'll understand 
once you actually play her.

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:24.720
Suzumegahara Municipal Junior High

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:31.930
<b>Table Tennis 
Team</b>

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:47.770
K-Kamiya-san! Morning!

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:49.720
Morning...

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.290
You didn't get lost today, huh?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.280
K-Kamiya-san.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.710
Until the others arrive, would you 
mind practicing with me for a bit?

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:10.260
I... want to play with you.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.350
<b>Kamiya Agari</b>

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.350
<b>Tsumujikaze Koyori</b>

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:16.940
Table Tennis 
Room

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:16.280
S-Sorry, but I want to work 
on adjusting my swing today.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.450
We can work on it together, then...

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:32.040
<b>Class 2-3</b>

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.750
It's lunch break!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.080
I'll go get Hokuto!

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.540
I'm having bread for lunch today, 
so I'll eat in the cafeteria.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:44.900
Kamiya-san?

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:46.300
Don't wait for me.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.570
You three eat up.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.890
And, like, Juri's a really good singer.

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.810
What? I'm so jelly!

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.210
What am I doing?

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:20.220
Excuse me.

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:21.540
Aren't you from the school paper?

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:24.770
I thought you finished 
your story on Agari-chan.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:26.940
The interview, yeah.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.390
But the photos were...

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:31.610
Well, I'd like to take a few more.

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:32.980
Where's Kamiya-san?

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.020
She's practicing by herself.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.980
Said she wanted to run and left.

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.630
Oh, okay.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.360
Another winner for Hanabi-senpai!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.030
Could you even see that? Crazy!

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:50.550
<i>Hanabi's a quintessential 
penhold counter driver.</i>

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:54.040
<i>Staying close to the table, she drives 
the opponent's shots back at speed...</i>

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.290
<i>An extremely offense-focused player.</i>

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:59.660
<i>Her play style inevitably turns 
rallies into power showdowns.</i>

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.590
<i>Stopping the speed of her 
hits is no easy task.</i>

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.130
Beam, beam.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:17.890
<i>Wow, this is amazing.</i>

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.100
<i>I've never seen speed like this before.</i>

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.100
<i>Just how fast can her drives get?</i>

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:24.980
Ha!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.350
Taily!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.810
Is that the girl from the
 day before yesterday?

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.340
Was she always like that?

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:39.500
<i>Yeah, Koyori-chan turns into a different 
person when playing table tennis.</i>

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:44.540
<i>The amazing thing about her is that be 
it me, Hokuto-chan, or Hanabi-chan...</i>

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.340
<i>She can match whoever she faces, 
no matter what their play style.</i>

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:50.300
<i>And what's even more amazing 
is that smile of hers!</i>

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:56.180
Th-That one...

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.890
That one was really fast!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:02.690
Y-You're awesome, Hana-chan!

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.100
You bet I am!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.560
There's more where that came from, Taily!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.770
Yeah!

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:10.340
Do your best, Koyori-senpai!

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:11.990
Hanabi-senpai, too!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.450
What, am I playing second fiddle now?

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:18.860
<i>I stayed out too late.</i>

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:21.160
<i>I wonder if everyone's worried about me.</i>

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.340
Koyori-senpai won!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.260
She's so good!

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:36.640
You're awesome, Taily, damn you!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.820
You're incredible, Koyori-senpai!

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:40.530
An unstoppable force!

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:42.600
You're our new ace!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:45.080
The star that carries our team's hopes!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.320
Koyori-senpai, play with me.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:04.870
You're so awesome, team ace.

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:07.130
Wait...

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:10.120
I... I...

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:23.610
Koyori-senpai.

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:24.390
Senpai.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:25.570
Senpai!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.170
You...

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.250
You... jerks!

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:34.680
You're all jerks!

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:45.620
What's with that Agari?

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:49.580
Senpai, please help me after practice today.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:56.230
We would've gladly practiced 
with her if she'd asked.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.750
It might be my fault.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:04.220
I feel like Kamiya-san's avoiding me today

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:06.600
because I'm such a klutz.

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:14.860
I bet she's really mad at me!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.630
No way.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:17.950
Yeah, no way!

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:22.180
White Panties certainly is a difficult one,

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.120
but she wouldn't get mad 
over something like that.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.290
She would never!

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:29.310
She may have a thorny exterior, 
but she's a nice girl deep down!

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.290
She helped you out loads in these 
past three days, didn't she?

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:34.800
Yeah.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.090
I bet that right now

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:39.570
she's practicing a special move to 
prepare for tomorrow's match with you.

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:42.260
She's our team ace, after all.

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:47.940
All right! You've gotta eat, too!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.050
Here, have this, Taily!

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.910
Yeah, thanks.

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:56.440
Hanabi, I bought that.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.480
Say, Hokuto.

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:07.410
Doesn't playing Taily make 
something explode inside you?

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.050
What the heck?

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:12.500
Like, it gets you all excited.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.420
It didn't happen to you?

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:16.340
It did.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.640
I knew it!

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.450
I wonder what that's all about.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:21.840
Seriously.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:23.940
What a strange girl.

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:29.240
<i>Munemune-senpai, Itsumo-san, Hana-chan...</i>

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:31.220
<i>It was fun playing all of them.</i>

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:35.330
<i>But that feeling when I played 
Kamiya-san was something else.</i>

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:36.770
<i>Just what was it?</i>

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:42.990
I hope I'll find out tomorrow.

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.450
Agari-chan.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:56.510
You don't want to practice 
the forehand smash?

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.350
Why do you ask?

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:00.720
Because you've been focusing 
only on your backhand.

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:06.210
I put away my forehand a long time ago.

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:08.720
It doesn't result in enough winners.

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:12.630
Sure, the forehand may generate more power,

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:14.200
but that means nothing if it isn't effective.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:18.730
It's more efficient to refine 
my more decisive backhand.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.530
But you were having so much 
fun when you played forehand.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.550
Th-That doesn't matter.

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:27.240
I'll do whatever it takes to win.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.830
Agari-chan...

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:31.280
You seem to be having a 
hard time. Are you okay?

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:32.780
Sure you haven't backed 
yourself into a corner?

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:33.900
I'm fine!

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.840
<b>Kamiya Agari

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:46.050
Are you enjoying table tennis 
right now, Agari-chan?

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:56.060
I know that you're always first to practice.

00:20:57.090 --> 00:21:01.500
I know that you've been more dedicated 
and worked harder than anyone.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:04.740
<b>Kamiya Agari</b>

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:04.740
And that is proof that you did, isn't it?

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:07.450
Hard work will never betray you.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:10.700
So please don't look so pained.

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:13.880
Senpai.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:17.290
Your rack's too hot and stuffy.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.950
It's not hot or stuffy!

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:20.760
Sheesh.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:23.450
And here I was playing 
the kind senior for you.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:26.020
You're right.

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:30.490
I've practiced harder 
than anyone on the team.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:33.930
<b>Kamiya Agari</b>

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:33.930
And it was all to make that spot mine.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.120
I'm the ace.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.690
I will not relinquish that spot to anyone.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.270
Agari-chan.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.200
Suzumegahara Municipal Junior High

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:54.750
<b>Kamiya Agari

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:54.750
Only Agari-senpai's left now.

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.660
Will they play today?

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:07.470
Tsumujikaze-san.

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:08.340
Y-Yes?

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:12.450
Play me.

00:23:43.770 --> 00:24:00.000
Preview

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:46.980
Number one!

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:46.980
Ordinary...

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:49.060
You're awesome, Agari-chan!

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:49.820
Who's better?

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:51.110
Koyori-senpai?

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:51.770
It's gotta be Koyori-senpai.

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.360
I'm really looking forward to this.

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:53.360
I'll crush you!

00:23:53.360 --> 00:23:57.750
I like how table tennis lets you see your 
opponent's face really well up close. {HYPE!}
